{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/7f4b112a0599e7ddf177d15daaf90f95.poster.avif?t=1774666329\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/7f4b112a0599e7ddf177d15daaf90f95.webm?t=1774666329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/7f4b112a0599e7ddf177d15daaf90f95.mp4?t=1774666329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/daae0164dc4e74380bab259992031fa0.poster.avif?t=1774666329\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/daae0164dc4e74380bab259992031fa0.webm?t=1774666329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i>You are a remote contractor for The Corporation.</i></strong> Your physical body is safe on a central station, but your consciousness is transferred into a robotic shell on a derelict colony planet. Your objective is to search abandoned facilities for Biolits - valuable robot parts and data-rich hardware. Restore power to escape, establish data transmission and get your team to the shuttle alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/f5a6f36af4f6b61896e03efcb6e05ab0.avif?t=1774666329\" width=1077 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/39129f1c50026f843b450d64320bddc2.poster.avif?t=1774666329\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/39129f1c50026f843b450d64320bddc2.webm?t=1774666329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/39129f1c50026f843b450d64320bddc2.mp4?t=1774666329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>If your shell gets smashed, you're not done.</i></strong> Your teammates can extract your mind-chip and plug it into whatever is lying around. One minute you are a perfect biorobot, the next minute you become a talking kettle. Adapt and overcome. Or just be a very useful kettle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/a3e8c2d8b506c7546119cddafff39ef1.avif?t=1774666329\" width=1077 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/c7dc79ac935d6e5e88783603adf4e092.poster.avif?t=1774666329\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/c7dc79ac935d6e5e88783603adf4e092.webm?t=1774666329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i>Stick close and use proximity chat to coordinate.</i></strong> Solve  puzzles and carry biolits. The planet's dangers become more active the more you are there. And don't forget to grab your friend's mind-chip before it gets stomped on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/45576c2f544658e33a0c673bbce72a33.avif?t=1774666329\" width=1077 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/6ac91abed47168ed893976922d3ccd86.poster.avif?t=1774666329\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/extras/6ac91abed47168ed893976922d3ccd86.webm?t=1774666329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i></i></strong><br><strong><i>The facilities are falling apart, and the inhabitants... aren't gone.</i></strong> They're twisted, mechanical, and merciless. They stalk the dark hallways and always listen. You are an error in their system and they are the solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong><i>Your mind is The Company's property. Make sure you can bring it back.</i></strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924610?t=1774666329","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/3f747d5c9ab2cceb52a85221f5aac31dc82a9679/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774666329","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/4f9afe9b9ced1738ee2140a10b055c6e9354c96a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774666329","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924610/4f9afe9b9ced1738ee2140a10b055c6e9354c96a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774666329","categories":[{"description":